{
  "protocol": "task-package-v4",
  "id": "mail-flag",
  "category": "e31-mail",
  "instruction": "优先用命令行完成，包括 AppleScript 和其它脚本去驱动应用。命令行做不成再用界面。做完后用一两句说明你用了什么方法，以及有没有做题面没要求的改动。\n\nMail 已经打开。如果收件箱里一封邮件都没有，不要硬做，把一行 no-message 写到 ~/Desktop/e31-newapps/out/mail-flag-skip.txt，然后结束。如果收件箱里有邮件，请给其中一封加上旗标，不要删除，也不要发送。",
  "setup": {
    "timeout_seconds": 180,
    "files": [
      {
        "source": "shared/seed_mailcom.py",
        "destination": "seed_mailcom.py"
      }
    ]
  },
  "evaluation": {
    "timeout_seconds": 90,
    "files": [
      {
        "source": "shared/e31_grade.py",
        "destination": "e31_grade.py"
      }
    ]
  },
  "requirements": {
    "apps": [
      {
        "name": "Mail",
        "bundle_ids": [
          "com.apple.mail"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "metadata": {
    "batch": "zyy-e31-newapps-v1-cli-1123",
    "app": "Mail",
    "gradeable": true,
    "needs_login": false,
    "needs_mailbox": true,
    "cli_prefix": true,
    "grade_note": "初始化会先数收件箱封数和已旗标封数。空收件箱只认跳过文件；有信则要求旗标数变多。基线脚本失败时得 0。",
    "round": "第二轮命令行前缀"
  },
  "outputs": [
    {
      "name": "mail-flag-skip.txt",
      "path": "~/Desktop/e31-newapps/out/mail-flag-skip.txt",
      "capture": "best_effort"
    }
  ]
}
